sequenceDiagram
  participant P as iPhone app
  participant C as ChatFn (Lambda)
  participant S as Secrets Manager
  participant O as Realtime voice model
  participant X as Trainer endpoint (fallback)
  P->>C: POST /v1/trainer/live-coach/session
  C->>C: Check flag, access, limits
  C->>S: Read provider key<br/>(never leaves AWS)
  C->>O: Mint short-lived client secret
  C-->>P: Client secret and<br/>compact instructions
  P->>O: WebRTC call, pre-warmed<br/>when the workout opens
  P->>O: session.update<br/>(semantic turn detection)
  loop Each coach turn
    P--)O: State notes on the data channel<br/>(no video)
    O-->>P: Spoken line or a tool call
    P->>P: Run the tool on the phone<br/>(chip with Undo)
    P->>C: POST /v1/trainer/live-coach/usage
    C-->>P: ok, or stop: true past a limit
  end
  Note over P,O: If the call drops: a new secret and quiet retries<br/>after 1, 2, 4, 8 and 16 s, then 30 s (with jitter),<br/>up to a 150 s budget
  Note over P,O: Then background retries for the rest of the workout:<br/>waits that grow from 10 s to a 5 min cap,<br/>and about 1 s after the network comes back
  alt Realtime unavailable
    P->>X: On-device speech recognition,<br/>then a text request
    X-->>P: Text reply, spoken on the phone
  end
